WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
A starting point for Downloads.
Review suggestions. Keep the final say.

00:03.000 --> 00:09.000
A matching app appears installed.
Check that you no longer need its disk image.

00:09.000 --> 00:17.000
These sample PDFs match after a content check.
Decide which copy you need. Nothing is selected automatically.

00:17.000 --> 00:22.000
An old export might still matter.
Age is a reason to review, not proof it is unwanted.

00:22.000 --> 00:28.000
Hide the suggestion. The file stays in Downloads.
The suggestion stays hidden until changed or restored in Settings.

00:28.000 --> 00:33.000
Select only the files you no longer need.
Choose Move to Trash to open the confirmation.

00:33.000 --> 00:41.000
The confirmation names your selected file. You can cancel here.
Recover files in Finder before emptying Trash.

00:41.000 --> 00:45.000
Try Trayage for Mac. File review is free.
You choose what moves. Trayage never empties the Trash.
